<title>USA: Global TeleMedia yr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Global TeleMedia yr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper loss		 $5,374     loss	$2,321</p>
<p> Revs			 1,392		    2,864</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company's full name is Global TeleMedia International Inc.</p>
<p>The company also said it had additional one-time costs for launching its wholly owned network marketing subsidiary, Vision 21 Inc.</p>
<p>Above loss is net loss from operations.</p>
